# Project Structure

## lib/ directory — physical client/server boundary

```
lib/
  server/              # NEVER import from 'use client' components (enforced by server-only)
    mongodb.ts
    crypto.ts
    prompts/           # YAML templates + builder.ts + renderer.ts
  client/              # All 'use client' code
    contexts/          # auth.tsx, settings.tsx, chat.tsx (split, barrel index.ts)
    story/             # context.tsx, export.ts
  shared/              # Pure functions + types — safe to import from anywhere
    types.ts
    characters.ts
    agent.ts
    useAutoSave.ts
    story/             # parser.ts, prompts.ts (constants)
  models/              # Mongoose schemas
  tools/               # Tool registry
```

## Rules

- **`lib/server/`**: Has `import 'server-only'` — build error if imported from client code
- **`lib/client/`**: All files use `'use client'` — React contexts, hooks, browser-only code
- **`lib/shared/`**: No side effects, no server/client dependencies — importable everywhere
- **Never import from `lib/server/` in components or client code**
- **Prompts are server-side only**: Client sends `promptParams`, API routes call `buildSystemPrompt()`
- **One `.yaml` file per prompt type** in `lib/server/prompts/`

## components/ directory

```
components/
  roleplay/            # ChatInput, ChatWindow, ChatMessage, SettingsPanel, SidebarLeft, etc.
  story/               # StoryWindow, StoryInput, StoryHeader, StorySettings, StorySidebar
  shared/              # Header, ErrorToast, EditProfileModal
```
